      "cited_excerpt": "Uses vite for the time question, kjenne for acquaintance and kunne for equipment ability.",
      "created_against_sha256": "8c1315ffb5b1574c7c5e80f18a2d9a1a4355fcb5e7ddf0aa98a043feb63e1b9a",
      "criterion": "visible_prompt_rubric_alignment",
      "details": "Actual independent content review by /root/lesson_content_review_3; report SHA256 b803aef3454eeedee6da39d8ce850a131f827af633061a23b83e3d8800f95edf; original target further_practice_planning_a_concert. Owner acceptance does not resolve this advisory.",
      "excerpt": "Uses vite for the time question, kjenne for acquaintance and kunne for equipment ability.",
      "explanation": "The visible task asks Per to ask when the concert begins, but the rubric requires vite specifically in the time question. A completely natural question such as «Når begynner konserten?» meets the visible task and is nevertheless disallowed by this hidden requirement.",
      "finding_id": "codex-knowing_verbs_vite_kjenne_kunne-3-0",
      "key": "further_practice_planning_a_concert",
      "message": "",
      "previously_resolved": false,
