      "criterion": "standalone_exercise_context",
      "details": "Actual independent content review by /root/lesson_content_review_3; report SHA256 b803aef3454eeedee6da39d8ce850a131f827af633061a23b83e3d8800f95edf; original target contextual_practice_lea_first_day. Owner acceptance does not resolve this advisory.",
      "excerpt": "Fortell hvor koppene skal stå",
      "explanation": "The visible task asks the learner to tell Ingrid where the cups should stand. Its dialogue says only that Arne showed Lea where they belong, without supplying the actual location. Even the earlier lesson only mentions that Arne showed her a cupboard, so an independently attempted exercise cannot supply this requested concrete fact. The rubric instead checks merely that Lea knows where they belong.",
      "finding_id": "codex-knowing_verbs_vite_kjenne_kunne-3-2",
      "key": "contextual_practice_lea_first_day",
      "message": "",
